  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hi,\n\nI made a private world, then made it my home and people were able to join separate instances of my home world even though I have it listed as private. They weren't able to join the one i was in, but were booted to an instance of my private world. so they could gain access to it. I don't know if this is a bug or not. \n\n- Thanks MemoMii",
